+/**
+ * @file
+ * AAC decoder
+ * @author Oded Shimon  ( ods15 ods15 dyndns org )
+ * @author Maxim Gavrilov ( maxim.gavrilov gmail com )
+ *
+ * Fixed point implementation
+ * @author Stanislav Ocovaj ( stanislav.ocovaj imgtec com )
