+/*
+ * - CrystalHD decoder module -
+ *
+ * Copyright(C) 2010,2011 Philip Langdale <ffmpeg.philipl@overt.org>
+ *
+ * This file is part of FFmpeg.
+ *
+ * FFmpeg is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
